Package: guatiao
Type: Package
Title: Values, Schemas and Plugin Libraries Across Languages
Version: 0.0.0.1
Authors@R: person("jose-pr", email = "jose-pr@coqui.dev", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Bindings over the 'guatiao' C library: values shared with C,
    Rust, Python, Dart, Node, Go and Julia code without copying their shape,
    their JSON Schema descriptions, and a registry of plugin libraries whose
    providers a host calls through typed function tables. JSON, TOML and
    YAML are the package 'guatiao.serde', forms 'guatiao.intake', both built
    on the C interface this package registers. A provider can be written in R as an S4 or Reference
    class. The 'guatiao' library itself is not included: it is opened at run
    time from the path in 'GUATIAO_LIBRARY'.
License: MPL-2.0
URL: https://github.com/Boriken-Dev/guatiao, https://boriken-dev.github.io/guatiao/
BugReports: https://github.com/Boriken-Dev/guatiao/issues
Depends: R (>= 4.2)
Imports: methods, utils
Suggests: bit64
SystemRequirements: libffi
Encoding: UTF-8
NeedsCompilation: yes
Collate: native.R value.R time.R typed.R schema.R kinds.R registry.R provide.R wire.R
